<title>UK: DB Capital Markets set warrants on gold and silver.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets set warrants on gold and silver.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued 30 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, three tranches on gold and three tranches on silver, lead manager Deutsche Bank said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.OCT.96-26.SEP.97   PAYDATE	16.OCT.96</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  GOLD - $380.90, SILVER - $4.88.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE	ISSUE	 GEARING	PREMIUM</p>
<p> GOLD CALL     $385	  $1.11	 34.32 PCT    3.99 X</p>
<p> GOLD CALL     $400	  $1.75	 21.77 PCT    9.60 X</p>
<p> GOLD PUT	$375	  $0.67	 56.85 PCT    3.31 X</p>
<p> SILVER CALL   $4.90	 $5.16	 9.46 PCT     10.98 X</p>
<p> SILVER CALL   $5.10	 $4.25	 11.48 PCT    13.21 X</p>
<p> SILVER PUT    $4.75	 $2.72	 17.94 PCT    8.24 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
